{"ok": true, "summary": "The interactive Gantt chart compares receipt-order dispatching with an explainable AI heuristic: earliest due date first, capability filtering, and assignment to the line with the earliest projected completion, including changeovers. Same-family pull-ahead is permitted only when a look-ahead simulation reduces total changeover without making any otherwise-on-time pending order late. This protects weekend rush orders while exploiting compatible sequences; it is a heuristic, not a proven optimum. Both schedules pause production and changeovers during breaks and overnight. Initial setups are assumed ready, so the first order on each line incurs no changeover. Utilisation counts production only against available working time through the shop’s final completion. Calendar-hour makespan includes downtime; the page computes both schedules and their comparison directly.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Assembly scheduling</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel,#detail{position:absolute;top:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;max-width:300px}\n#panel{left:12px}#detail{right:12px;width:290px;max-height:45%;overflow:auto}\nh3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:14px}button{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font:11px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}#buttons{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-top:6px}\ntable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:3px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}\n.swatch{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;margin-right:3px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:48%;left:10%;right:10%;color:#b00020;background:white;padding:16px;text-align:center}\n#hint{position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:12px;font-size:11px;background:#ffffffd9;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:6px}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3 id=\"title\">AI schedule · EEV assembly</h3>\n<div id=\"kpis\"></div>\n<div><span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#2563eb\"></span>A\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#15803d\"></span>B\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#d97706\"></span>C · grey: setup</div>\n<div>Red cap: late · magenta pin: due · shade: downtime</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"mode\">Veteran method</button><button id=\"details\">Hide details</button><button id=\"view\">Top view</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"detail\"><h3>Dispatch details</h3><div id=\"rows\"></div></div>\n<div id=\"hint\">Drag to orbit · scroll to zoom · right-drag to pan · time origin: Monday 08:00</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Calendar hours from Monday 08:00; due dates are cumulative working hours.\n  lines:[{id:'L1',families:['A','B','C']},{id:'L2',families:['A','B','C']},{id:'L3',families:['C']}],\n  orders:[\n    {id:'O01',family:'A',hours:8,due:56},{id:'O02',family:'B',hours:7,due:60},\n    {id:'O03',family:'C',hours:9,due:64},{id:'O04',family:'A',hours:6,due:48},\n    {id:'O05',family:'B',hours:5,due:52},{id:'O06',family:'C',hours:6,due:44},\n    {id:'O07',family:'B',hours:4,due:22},{id:'O08',family:'A',hours:5,due:26},\n    {id:'O09',family:'C',hours:6,due:30},{id:'O10',family:'A',hours:4,due:12},\n    {id:'O11',family:'B',hours:3,due:14},{id:'O12',family:'A',hours:5,due:20}\n  ],\n  changeover:{A:{A:.5,B:2,C:2},B:{A:2,B:.5,C:2},C:{A:2,B:2,C:.5}},\n  calendar:{period:24,windows:[[0,4],[4.5,12],[12.5,16]],origin:8},\n  initialSetup:0,\n  // All scene dimensions are millimetres; X scale is millimetres per calendar hour.\n  scale:10,rowPitch:70,rowWidth:40,barHeight:14,setupHeight:6,capHeight:3,\n  dueDiameter:2,dueHeight:24,tickHours:8,\n  colors:{A:'#2563eb',B:'#15803d',C:'#d97706',setup:'#9aa3ab',late:'#dc2626',due:'#b11f4b'},\n  material:{metalness:.1,roughness:.7,downtimeOpacity:.18},\n  epsilon:1e-8\n};\nconst showError = message => {const el=document.getElementById('error');el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Scheduling error: '+message;};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n  function workSegments(t,h){\n    const parts=[];\n    while(h>P.epsilon){\n      const day=Math.floor(t/P.calendar.period);let advanced=false;\n      for(const [a,b] of P.calendar.windows){\n        const start=Math.max(t,day*24+a),end=day*24+b;\n        if(start<end-P.epsilon){\n          const used=Math.min(h,end-start);parts.push([start,start+used]);\n          t=start+used;h-=used;advanced=true;if(h<P.epsilon)break;\n        }\n      }\n      if(h>P.epsilon)t=(day+1)*24;\n      if(!advanced&&h<P.epsilon)break;\n    }\n    return {end:t,parts};\n  }\n  function addWorkHours(t,h){return workSegments(t,h).end;}\n  function available(t){\n    let total=0;\n    for(let d=0;d*24<t;d++)for(const [a,b] of P.calendar.windows)total+=Math.max(0,Math.min(t,d*24+b)-(d*24+a));\n    return total;\n  }\n  const orders=P.orders.map(o=>({...o,dueTime:addWorkHours(0,o.due)}));\n  const edd=(a,b)=>a.due-b.due||a.id.localeCompare(b.id);\n  const fresh=()=>P.lines.map(()=>({end:0,last:null,production:0}));\n  const clone=s=>s.map(x=>({...x}));\n  function choice(order,state,method){\n    const options=[];\n    P.lines.forEach((line,i)=>{\n      if(!line.families.includes(order.family))return;\n      const old=state[i],setup=old.last?P.changeover[old.last][order.family]:P.initialSetup;\n      const prep=workSegments(old.end,setup),run=workSegments(prep.end,order.hours);\n      options.push({order,line:i,setup,prep:prep.parts,parts:run.parts,start:run.parts[0][0],end:run.end,free:old.end});\n    });\n    options.sort((a,b)=>method==='veteran'?a.free-b.free||a.line-b.line:a.end-b.end||a.line-b.line);\n    if(!options.length)throw new Error('No capable line for '+order.id);\n    return options[0];\n  }\n  function commit(job,state){\n    const s=state[job.line];s.end=job.end;s.last=job.order.family;s.production+=job.order.hours;\n    job.late=job.end>job.order.dueTime+P.epsilon;return job;\n  }\n  function rollout(state,pending,first){\n    const s=clone(state),list=first?[first,...pending.filter(o=>o.id!==first.id).sort(edd)]:[...pending].sort(edd);\n    return list.map(o=>commit(choice(o,s,'ai'),s));\n  }\n  function schedule(method){\n    const state=fresh(),jobs=[],decisions=[];\n    let pending=[...orders].sort(method==='ai'?edd:(a,b)=>a.id.localeCompare(b.id));\n    while(pending.length){\n      let order=pending[0];\n      if(method==='ai'&&pending.length>1){\n        const baseline=rollout(state,pending),baseSetup=baseline.reduce((s,j)=>s+j.setup,0);\n        let bestSaving=P.epsilon;\n        for(const candidate of pending.slice(1)){\n          const next=choice(candidate,state,'ai');\n          if(state[next.line].last!==candidate.family)continue;\n          const trial=rollout(state,pending,candidate),byId=new Map(trial.map(j=>[j.order.id,j]));\n          const safe=baseline.every(j=>j.late||!byId.get(j.order.id).late);\n          const saving=baseSetup-trial.reduce((s,j)=>s+j.setup,0);\n          if(safe&&saving>bestSaving){order=candidate;bestSaving=saving;}\n        }\n        if(order.id!==pending[0].id)decisions.push(order.id+' pulled ahead: safe family batching');\n      }\n      jobs.push(commit(choice(order,state,method),state));\n      pending=pending.filter(o=>o.id!==order.id);\n    }\n    const makespan=Math.max(...state.map(s=>s.end)),capacity=available(makespan);\n    const late=jobs.filter(j=>j.late).length,util=state.map(s=>100*s.production/capacity);\n    return {jobs,decisions,makespan,late,ontime:100*(jobs.length-late)/jobs.length,\n      setup:jobs.reduce((s,j)=>s+j.setup,0),util,average:util.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/util.length};\n  }\n  const ai=schedule('ai'),veteran=schedule('veteran'),fmt=n=>n.toFixed(1);\n  const pair=key=>fmt(ai[key])+' / '+fmt(veteran[key]);\n  const note='Page calculations are authoritative.';\n  window.__metrics=[\n    {label:'Makespan AI/veteran (h)',value:pair('makespan'),unit:'h',note},\n    {label:'On-time rate AI/veteran (%)',value:pair('ontime'),unit:'%',note},\n    {label:'Late orders AI/veteran',value:ai.late+' / '+veteran.late,unit:'orders',note},\n    {label:'Changeover time AI/veteran (h)',value:pair('setup'),unit:'h',note},\n    {label:'Average utilisation AI/veteran (%)',value:pair('average'),unit:'%',note},\n    {label:'Per-line utilisation AI (%)',value:ai.util.map((u,i)=>P.lines[i].id+': '+fmt(u)).join(' / '),unit:'%',note}\n  ];\n  window.__schedules={ai,veteran};window.__parameters=P;\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  document.body.prepend(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);light.position.set(200,600,300);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);controls.enableDamping=true;\n  controls.autoRotate=false;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1;controls.addEventListener('start',()=>controls.autoRotate=false);\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  let mode='ai',top=false;\n  const materials={};\n  function mat(color,opacity=1){\n    const key=color+opacity;\n    if(!materials[key])materials[key]=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,...{metalness:P.material.metalness,roughness:P.material.roughness},transparent:opacity<1,opacity,depthWrite:opacity===1});\n    return materials[key];\n  }\n  function box(x,y,z,w,h,d,color,opacity=1){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),mat(color,opacity));mesh.position.set(x,y,z);modelGroup.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  function label(text,x,y,z,width=55){\n    const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=512;canvas.height=80;\n    const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');ctx.font='32px Segoe UI, sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='middle';\n    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.85)';ctx.fillRect(0,0,512,80);ctx.fillStyle='#253348';ctx.fillText(text,256,40);\n    const material=new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas),depthTest:false});\n    const sprite=new THREE.Sprite(material);sprite.position.set(x,y,z);sprite.scale.set(width,width*80/512,1);modelGroup.add(sprite);\n  }\n  function stamp(t){\n    const minutes=Math.round((t+P.calendar.origin)*60),day=Math.floor(minutes/1440)+1;\n    return 'D'+day+' '+String(Math.floor(minutes%1440/60)).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(minutes%60).padStart(2,'0');\n  }\n  function fit(){\n    const bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true),center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n    const radius=size.length()/2,angle=Math.min(camera.fov*Math.PI/360,Math.atan(Math.tan(camera.fov*Math.PI/360)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=radius/Math.sin(angle)/.8;\n    camera.up.set(0,1,0);camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(...(top?[0,1,.001]:[.05,.75,1])).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);camera.lookAt(center);controls.update();\n  }\n  function draw(){\n    modelGroup.traverse(o=>{\n      if(o.geometry)o.geometry.dispose();\n      if(o.isSprite){o.material.map.dispose();o.material.dispose();}\n    });modelGroup.clear();\n    const result=mode==='ai'?ai:veteran;\n    const horizon=Math.ceil(Math.max(ai.makespan,veteran.makespan,...orders.map(o=>o.dueTime))/8)*8;\n    const width=(P.lines.length-1)*P.rowPitch+P.rowWidth;\n    for(let d=0;d*24<horizon;d++){\n      const gaps=[[4,4.5],[12,12.5],[16,24]];\n      gaps.forEach(([a,b])=>{const start=d*24+a,end=Math.min(horizon,d*24+b);\n        if(end>start)box((start+end)*P.scale/2,15,70,(end-start)*P.scale,36,width,'#333333',P.material.downtimeOpacity);\n      });\n    }\n    for(let t=0;t<=horizon;t+=P.tickHours){\n      box(t*P.scale,-1,70,.5,1,width+20,'#d1d5db');label(stamp(t),t*P.scale,1,width+1,66);\n    }\n    P.lines.forEach((line,i)=>{\n      box(horizon*P.scale/2,-2,i*P.rowPitch,horizon*P.scale,1,P.rowWidth,'#e6e9ed');\n      label(line.id+(i===2?' · C only':''),-45,9,i*P.rowPitch,70);\n    });\n    result.jobs.forEach(job=>{\n      const z=job.line*P.rowPitch;\n      job.prep.forEach(([a,b])=>box((a+b)*P.scale/2,P.setupHeight/2,z,(b-a)*P.scale,P.setupHeight,P.rowWidth,P.colors.setup));\n      job.parts.forEach(([a,b])=>{\n        box((a+b)*P.scale/2,P.barHeight/2,z,(b-a)*P.scale,P.barHeight,P.rowWidth,P.colors[job.order.family]);\n        if(job.late)box((a+b)*P.scale/2,P.barHeight+P.capHeight/2,z,(b-a)*P.scale,P.capHeight,P.rowWidth,P.colors.late);\n      });\n      const longest=job.parts.reduce((a,b)=>b[1]-b[0]>a[1]-a[0]?b:a);\n      label(job.order.id,(longest[0]+longest[1])*P.scale/2,23,z,32);\n      const pin=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.dueDiameter/2,P.dueDiameter/2,P.dueHeight,8),mat(P.colors.due));\n      pin.position.set(job.order.dueTime*P.scale,P.dueHeight/2,z-P.rowWidth/2-3);modelGroup.add(pin);\n    });\n    document.getElementById('title').textContent=(mode==='ai'?'AI schedule':'Veteran method')+' · EEV assembly';\n    document.getElementById('kpis').innerHTML=\n      '<div>Makespan: '+fmt(result.makespan)+' calendar h</div><div>On time: '+fmt(result.ontime)+'%</div>'+\n      '<div>Late orders: '+result.late+' / '+orders.length+'</div><div>Changeover: '+fmt(result.setup)+' working h</div>'+\n      '<div>Mean utilisation: '+fmt(result.average)+'%</div><div>'+result.util.map((u,i)=>P.lines[i].id+' '+fmt(u)+'%').join(' · ')+'</div>';\n    document.getElementById('rows').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Line</th><th>Start</th><th>Finish</th><th>Late</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+\n      [...result.jobs].sort((a,b)=>a.start-b.start||a.line-b.line).map(j=>'<tr><td>'+j.order.id+'</td><td>'+P.lines[j.line].id+'</td><td>'+stamp(j.start)+'</td><td>'+stamp(j.end)+'</td><td>'+(j.late?'Yes':'No')+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>'+\n      '<p>Start = first production segment; grey setup precedes it. Breaks split bars, not orders.</p>'+\n      '<p>AI: EDD → safe same-family pull-ahead → earliest completion. Ties: line ID. Veteran: receipt ID → earliest free; ties: line ID.</p>'+\n      '<p>First setups: ready. Calendar repeats daily; no weekend exclusion supplied. Utilisation excludes setup and downtime.</p>'+\n      '<p>Accepted pull-aheads: '+(result.decisions.join('; ')||'None')+'.</p>'+\n      '<table>'+window.__metrics.map(m=>'<tr><td>'+m.label+'</td><td>'+m.value+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n    fit();\n  }\n  document.getElementById('mode').onclick=()=>{\n    mode=mode==='ai'?'veteran':'ai';Object.assign(ai,schedule('ai'));Object.assign(veteran,schedule('veteran'));\n    document.getElementById('mode').textContent=mode==='ai'?'Veteran method':'AI schedule';draw();\n  };\n  document.getElementById('details').onclick=e=>{\n    const el=document.getElementById('detail'),hidden=el.style.display==='none';\n    el.style.display=hidden?'block':'none';e.target.textContent=hidden?'Hide details':'Show details';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('view').onclick=e=>{top=!top;e.target.textContent=top?'Perspective':'Top view';fit();};\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);fit();});\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  draw();\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Makespan AI/veteran (h)", "value": "47.5 / 54.0", "unit": "h", "note": "Page calculations are authoritative."}, {"label": "On-time rate AI/veteran (%)", "value": "100.0 / 75.0", "unit": "%", "note": "Page calculations are authoritative."}, {"label": "Late orders AI/veteran", "value": "0 / 3", "unit": "orders", "note": "Page calculations are authoritative."}, {"label": "Changeover time AI/veteran (h)", "value": "4.5 / 10.5", "unit": "h", "note": "Page calculations are authoritative."}, {"label": "Average utilisation AI/veteran (%)", "value": "75.6 / 63.8", "unit": "%", "note": "Page calculations are authoritative."}, {"label": "Per-line utilisation AI (%)", "value": "L1: 93.3 / L2: 63.3 / L3: 70.0", "unit": "%", "note": "Page calculations are authoritative."}], "suggestions": ["Compare this heuristic against an exact optimisation with rush-order priority.", "Add a breakdown on L2 Tuesday morning and reschedule unfinished orders.", "Show production, changeover, idle time, and downtime separately for each line."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nThe interactive Gantt chart compares receipt-order dispatching with an explainable AI heuristic: earliest due date first, capability filtering, and assignment to the line with the earliest projected completion, including changeovers. Same-family pull-ahead is permitted only when a look-ahead simulation reduces total changeover without making any otherwise-on-time pending order late. This protects weekend rush orders while exploiting compatible sequences; it is a heuristic, not a proven optimum. Both schedules pause production and changeovers during breaks and overnight. Initial setups are assumed ready, so the first order on each line incurs no changeover. Utilisation counts production only against available working time through the shop’s final completion. Calendar-hour makespan includes downtime; the page computes both schedules and their comparison directly.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Assembly scheduling</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel,#detail{position:absolute;top:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;max-width:300px}\n#panel{left:12px}#detail{right:12px;width:290px;max-height:45%;overflow:auto}\nh3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:14px}button{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font:11px \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}#buttons{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-top:6px}\ntable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:3px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}\n.swatch{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;margin-right:3px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:48%;left:10%;right:10%;color:#b00020;background:white;padding:16px;text-align:center}\n#hint{position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:12px;font-size:11px;background:#ffffffd9;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:6px}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3 id=\"title\">AI schedule · EEV assembly</h3>\n<div id=\"kpis\"></div>\n<div><span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#2563eb\"></span>A\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#15803d\"></span>B\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#d97706\"></span>C · grey: setup</div>\n<div>Red cap: late · magenta pin: due · shade: downtime</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"mode\">Veteran method</button><button id=\"details\">Hide details</button><button id=\"view\">Top view</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"detail\"><h3>Dispatch details</h3><div id=\"rows\"></div></div>\n<div id=\"hint\">Drag to orbit · scroll to zoom · right-drag to pan · time origin: Monday 08:00</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Calendar hours from Monday 08:00; due dates are cumulative working hours.\n  lines:[{id:'L1',families:['A','B','C']},{id:'L2',families:['A','B','C']},{id:'L3',families:['C']}],\n  orders:[\n    {id:'O01',family:'A',hours:8,due:56},{id:'O02',family:'B',hours:7,due:60},\n    {id:'O03',family:'C',hours:9,due:64},{id:'O04',family:'A',hours:6,due:48},\n    {id:'O05',family:'B',hours:5,due:52},{id:'O06',family:'C',hours:6,due:44},\n    {id:'O07',family:'B',hours:4,due:22},{id:'O08',family:'A',hours:5,due:26},\n    {id:'O09',family:'C',hours:6,due:30},{id:'O10',family:'A',hours:4,due:12},\n    {id:'O11',family:'B',hours:3,due:14},{id:'O12',family:'A',hours:5,due:20}\n  ],\n  changeover:{A:{A:.5,B:2,C:2},B:{A:2,B:.5,C:2},C:{A:2,B:2,C:.5}},\n  calendar:{period:24,windows:[[0,4],[4.5,12],[12.5,16]],origin:8},\n  initialSetup:0,\n  // All scene dimensions are millimetres; X scale is millimetres per calendar hour.\n  scale:10,rowPitch:70,rowWidth:40,barHeight:14,setupHeight:6,capHeight:3,\n  dueDiameter:2,dueHeight:24,tickHours:8,\n  colors:{A:'#2563eb',B:'#15803d',C:'#d97706',setup:'#9aa3ab',late:'#dc2626',due:'#b11f4b'},\n  material:{metalness:.1,roughness:.7,downtimeOpacity:.18},\n  epsilon:1e-8\n};\nconst showError = message => {const el=document.getElementById('error');el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Scheduling error: '+message;};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n  function workSegments(t,h){\n    const parts=[];\n    while(h>P.epsilon){\n      const day=Math.floor(t/P.calendar.period);let advanced=false;\n      for(const [a,b] of P.calendar.windows){\n        const start=Math.max(t,day*24+a),end=day*24+b;\n        if(start<end-P.epsilon){\n          const used=Math.min(h,end-start);parts.push([start,start+used]);\n          t=start+used;h-=used;advanced=true;if(h<P.epsilon)break;\n        }\n      }\n      if(h>P.epsilon)t=(day+1)*24;\n      if(!advanced&&h<P.epsilon)break;\n    }\n    return {end:t,parts};\n  }\n  function addWorkHours(t,h){return workSegments(t,h).end;}\n  function available(t){\n    let total=0;\n    for(let d=0;d*24<t;d++)for(const [a,b] of P.calendar.windows)total+=Math.max(0,Math.min(t,d*24+b)-(d*24+a));\n    return total;\n  }\n  const orders=P.orders.map(o=>({...o,dueTime:addWorkHours(0,o.due)}));\n  const edd=(a,b)=>a.due-b.due||a.id.localeCompare(b.id);\n  const fresh=()=>P.lines.map(()=>({end:0,last:null,production:0}));\n  const clone=s=>s.map(x=>({...x}));\n  function choice(order,state,method){\n    const options=[];\n    P.lines.forEach((line,i)=>{\n      if(!line.families.includes(order.family))return;\n      const old=state[i],setup=old.last?P.changeover[old.last][order.family]:P.initialSetup;\n      const prep=workSegments(old.end,setup),run=workSegments(prep.end,order.hours);\n      options.push({order,line:i,setup,prep:prep.parts,parts:run.parts,start:run.parts[0][0],end:run.end,free:old.end});\n    });\n    options.sort((a,b)=>method==='veteran'?a.free-b.free||a.line-b.line:a.end-b.end||a.line-b.line);\n    if(!options.length)throw new Error('No capable line for '+order.id);\n    return options[0];\n  }\n  function commit(job,state){\n    const s=state[job.line];s.end=job.end;s.last=job.order.family;s.production+=job.order.hours;\n    job.late=job.end>job.order.dueTime+P.epsilon;return job;\n  }\n  function rollout(state,pending,first){\n    const s=clone(state),list=first?[first,...pending.filter(o=>o.id!==first.id).sort(edd)]:[...pending].sort(edd);\n    return list.map(o=>commit(choice(o,s,'ai'),s));\n  }\n  function schedule(method){\n    const state=fresh(),jobs=[],decisions=[];\n    let pending=[...orders].sort(method==='ai'?edd:(a,b)=>a.id.localeCompare(b.id));\n    while(pending.length){\n      let order=pending[0];\n      if(method==='ai'&&pending.length>1){\n        const baseline=rollout(state,pending),baseSetup=baseline.reduce((s,j)=>s+j.setup,0);\n        let bestSaving=P.epsilon;\n        for(const candidate of pending.slice(1)){\n          const next=choice(candidate,state,'ai');\n          if(state[next.line].last!==candidate.family)continue;\n          const trial=rollout(state,pending,candidate),byId=new Map(trial.map(j=>[j.order.id,j]));\n          const safe=baseline.every(j=>j.late||!byId.get(j.order.id).late);\n          const saving=baseSetup-trial.reduce((s,j)=>s+j.setup,0);\n          if(safe&&saving>bestSaving){order=candidate;bestSaving=saving;}\n        }\n        if(order.id!==pending[0].id)decisions.push(order.id+' pulled ahead: safe family batching');\n      }\n      jobs.push(commit(choice(order,state,method),state));\n      pending=pending.filter(o=>o.id!==order.id);\n    }\n    const makespan=Math.max(...state.map(s=>s.end)),capacity=available(makespan);\n    const late=jobs.filter(j=>j.late).length,util=state.map(s=>100*s.production/capacity);\n    return {jobs,decisions,makespan,late,ontime:100*(jobs.length-late)/jobs.length,\n      setup:jobs.reduce((s,j)=>s+j.setup,0),util,average:util.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/util.length};\n  }\n  const ai=schedule('ai'),veteran=schedule('veteran'),fmt=n=>n.toFixed(1);\n  const pair=key=>fmt(ai[key])+' / '+fmt(veteran[key]);\n  const note='Page calculations are authoritative.';\n  window.__metrics=[\n    {label:'Makespan AI/veteran (h)',value:pair('makespan'),unit:'h',note},\n    {label:'On-time rate AI/veteran (%)',value:pair('ontime'),unit:'%',note},\n    {label:'Late orders AI/veteran',value:ai.late+' / '+veteran.late,unit:'orders',note},\n    {label:'Changeover time AI/veteran (h)',value:pair('setup'),unit:'h',note},\n    {label:'Average utilisation AI/veteran (%)',value:pair('average'),unit:'%',note},\n    {label:'Per-line utilisation AI (%)',value:ai.util.map((u,i)=>P.lines[i].id+': '+fmt(u)).join(' / '),unit:'%',note}\n  ];\n  window.__schedules={ai,veteran};window.__parameters=P;\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  document.body.prepend(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);light.position.set(200,600,300);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);controls.enableDamping=true;\n  controls.autoRotate=false;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1;controls.addEventListener('start',()=>controls.autoRotate=false);\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  let mode='ai',top=false;\n  const materials={};\n  function mat(color,opacity=1){\n    const key=color+opacity;\n    if(!materials[key])materials[key]=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,...{metalness:P.material.metalness,roughness:P.material.roughness},transparent:opacity<1,opacity,depthWrite:opacity===1});\n    return materials[key];\n  }\n  function box(x,y,z,w,h,d,color,opacity=1){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),mat(color,opacity));mesh.position.set(x,y,z);modelGroup.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  function label(text,x,y,z,width=55){\n    const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=512;canvas.height=80;\n    const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');ctx.font='32px Segoe UI, sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='middle';\n    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.85)';ctx.fillRect(0,0,512,80);ctx.fillStyle='#253348';ctx.fillText(text,256,40);\n    const material=new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas),depthTest:false});\n    const sprite=new THREE.Sprite(material);sprite.position.set(x,y,z);sprite.scale.set(width,width*80/512,1);modelGroup.add(sprite);\n  }\n  function stamp(t){\n    const minutes=Math.round((t+P.calendar.origin)*60),day=Math.floor(minutes/1440)+1;\n    return 'D'+day+' '+String(Math.floor(minutes%1440/60)).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(minutes%60).padStart(2,'0');\n  }\n  function fit(){\n    const bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true),center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n    const radius=size.length()/2,angle=Math.min(camera.fov*Math.PI/360,Math.atan(Math.tan(camera.fov*Math.PI/360)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=radius/Math.sin(angle)/.8;\n    camera.up.set(0,1,0);camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(...(top?[0,1,.001]:[.05,.75,1])).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);camera.lookAt(center);controls.update();\n  }\n  function draw(){\n    modelGroup.traverse(o=>{\n      if(o.geometry)o.geometry.dispose();\n      if(o.isSprite){o.material.map.dispose();o.material.dispose();}\n    });modelGroup.clear();\n    const result=mode==='ai'?ai:veteran;\n    const horizon=Math.ceil(Math.max(ai.makespan,veteran.makespan,...orders.map(o=>o.dueTime))/8)*8;\n    const width=(P.lines.length-1)*P.rowPitch+P.rowWidth;\n    for(let d=0;d*24<horizon;d++){\n      const gaps=[[4,4.5],[12,12.5],[16,24]];\n      gaps.forEach(([a,b])=>{const start=d*24+a,end=Math.min(horizon,d*24+b);\n        if(end>start)box((start+end)*P.scale/2,15,70,(end-start)*P.scale,36,width,'#333333',P.material.downtimeOpacity);\n      });\n    }\n    for(let t=0;t<=horizon;t+=P.tickHours){\n      box(t*P.scale,-1,70,.5,1,width+20,'#d1d5db');label(stamp(t),t*P.scale,1,width+1,66);\n    }\n    P.lines.forEach((line,i)=>{\n      box(horizon*P.scale/2,-2,i*P.rowPitch,horizon*P.scale,1,P.rowWidth,'#e6e9ed');\n      label(line.id+(i===2?' · C only':''),-45,9,i*P.rowPitch,70);\n    });\n    result.jobs.forEach(job=>{\n      const z=job.line*P.rowPitch;\n      job.prep.forEach(([a,b])=>box((a+b)*P.scale/2,P.setupHeight/2,z,(b-a)*P.scale,P.setupHeight,P.rowWidth,P.colors.setup));\n      job.parts.forEach(([a,b])=>{\n        box((a+b)*P.scale/2,P.barHeight/2,z,(b-a)*P.scale,P.barHeight,P.rowWidth,P.colors[job.order.family]);\n        if(job.late)box((a+b)*P.scale/2,P.barHeight+P.capHeight/2,z,(b-a)*P.scale,P.capHeight,P.rowWidth,P.colors.late);\n      });\n      const longest=job.parts.reduce((a,b)=>b[1]-b[0]>a[1]-a[0]?b:a);\n      label(job.order.id,(longest[0]+longest[1])*P.scale/2,23,z,32);\n      const pin=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.dueDiameter/2,P.dueDiameter/2,P.dueHeight,8),mat(P.colors.due));\n      pin.position.set(job.order.dueTime*P.scale,P.dueHeight/2,z-P.rowWidth/2-3);modelGroup.add(pin);\n    });\n    document.getElementById('title').textContent=(mode==='ai'?'AI schedule':'Veteran method')+' · EEV assembly';\n    document.getElementById('kpis').innerHTML=\n      '<div>Makespan: '+fmt(result.makespan)+' calendar h</div><div>On time: '+fmt(result.ontime)+'%</div>'+\n      '<div>Late orders: '+result.late+' / '+orders.length+'</div><div>Changeover: '+fmt(result.setup)+' working h</div>'+\n      '<div>Mean utilisation: '+fmt(result.average)+'%</div><div>'+result.util.map((u,i)=>P.lines[i].id+' '+fmt(u)+'%').join(' · ')+'</div>';\n    document.getElementById('rows').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Line</th><th>Start</th><th>Finish</th><th>Late</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+\n      [...result.jobs].sort((a,b)=>a.start-b.start||a.line-b.line).map(j=>'<tr><td>'+j.order.id+'</td><td>'+P.lines[j.line].id+'</td><td>'+stamp(j.start)+'</td><td>'+stamp(j.end)+'</td><td>'+(j.late?'Yes':'No')+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>'+\n      '<p>Start = first production segment; grey setup precedes it. Breaks split bars, not orders.</p>'+\n      '<p>AI: EDD → safe same-family pull-ahead → earliest completion. Ties: line ID. Veteran: receipt ID → earliest free; ties: line ID.</p>'+\n      '<p>First setups: ready. Calendar repeats daily; no weekend exclusion supplied. Utilisation excludes setup and downtime.</p>'+\n      '<p>Accepted pull-aheads: '+(result.decisions.join('; ')||'None')+'.</p>'+\n      '<table>'+window.__metrics.map(m=>'<tr><td>'+m.label+'</td><td>'+m.value+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n    fit();\n  }\n  document.getElementById('mode').onclick=()=>{\n    mode=mode==='ai'?'veteran':'ai';Object.assign(ai,schedule('ai'));Object.assign(veteran,schedule('veteran'));\n    document.getElementById('mode').textContent=mode==='ai'?'Veteran method':'AI schedule';draw();\n  };\n  document.getElementById('details').onclick=e=>{\n    const el=document.getElementById('detail'),hidden=el.style.display==='none';\n    el.style.display=hidden?'block':'none';e.target.textContent=hidden?'Hide details':'Show details';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('view').onclick=e=>{top=!top;e.target.textContent=top?'Perspective':'Top view';fit();};\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);fit();});\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  draw();\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n<<<METRICS>>>\n[\n  {\"label\":\"Makespan AI/veteran (h)\",\"value\":\"47.5 / 54.0\",\"unit\":\"h\",\"note\":\"Page calculations are authoritative.\"},\n  {\"label\":\"On-time rate AI/veter